WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I saw you in Brooklyn,
by the way,

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
performing your concert,
and I was --

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:04.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Madame X."

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Madame X."
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was unbelievable.
-Thank you.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:09.109
-And I -- What I loved about it

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:11.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
was that you chose
these smaller arenas.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:12.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
You always do stuff
that no one´s doing.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:16.216
You zig when people are zagging.
-Right.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughter ]
-And then, people --

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.286
You can quote me on that.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.822
And -- But here´s what I was
going to ask you. Do you --

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did I make any money?
-[ Chuckles ] No.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I wasn´t going
to ask you that.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn´t. [ Laughing ]
-I was going to ask you...

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:31.531
When people take your ideas --
you do all these things first.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.366
-Mm-hmm.
-And then people take your ideas

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.868
and they don´t give you credit,
and I go,

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.302
"No, Madonna did that already."

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.238 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah, and they also
don´t do it as good.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
I mean...

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:43.343 size:78% position:39%
-That´s -- [ Laughs ]
That´s exactly right.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:46.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That sounds really,
um, arrogant...

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-...but it´s kind of true.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Yeah.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:52.252
-"Madame X."
This is on Paramount+ tomorrow.

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.454 line:0%
What -- What do you hope
people take away from this,

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.122 line:0%
from watching this documentary?

00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:00.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um, that art is important
in our lives.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.163 size:81% position:41%
I don´t think people
emphasize that enough.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I -- I´m really inspired
by James Baldwin, the writer.

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Have you heard of him?

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course.
-Don´t lie.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.473
-I have heard of James Baldwin.
-Okay, yeah.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:18.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was a great source of
inspiration for me growing up,

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he was a great source
of inspiration for the show.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:25.452
And one of the things I quote
over and over again in the show

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
is that artists are here
to disturb the peace.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so --
-Wow.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so I hope
that I have disturbed

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:34.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
not only your peace
this afternoon but...

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:36.262
-You always disturb my peace.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...people´s peace
while they watch the show,

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.433
but I mean that in the best way.
-No, yeah.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
You get in good trouble.
-Good trouble.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.537 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, you really do.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, no, no!
Now, why would you --

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
Madonna. Madonna!

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.509
[ Sultry R&amp;B music plays ]

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
Stop, stop, stop, stop.
Stop it.

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my heavens.
Stop it. Stop it.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t know what to do.
Stop it right now.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.017 size:88% position:44%
Absolutely -- This is --

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No one´s gonna see anything.
My God.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sorry.

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:05.625 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.194
Oh, my gosh. Oh, my gosh.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.462 size:81% position:41%
Every -- Look at this.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:13.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.901 size:75% position:38%
I don´t know what --
I don´t what to --

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.871
-Because life is not just
about interviewing kiddies.

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:19.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay?
-Is that right?

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Don´t you want
to talk to an adult?

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.343 size:78% position:39%
-Is that right? Yeah.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let´s have some
adult conversation.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:25.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you talking to an adult
right now?

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´m not sure.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:32.218
I´m talking to someone who´s --
I feel, like, you´re --

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.220
You´re in some kind of conflict
right now.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, interesting.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, have you been
to a therapist?

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I went a --

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went once or twice.
I didn´t --

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:43.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
It wasn´t my thing.
-No.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.797 size:81% position:41%
-Do you go to therapy?

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.767 size:84% position:42%
-Um, I just -- I write.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:49.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
I write.
-So -- So, no?

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.373 size:88% position:44%
-It´s a form of therapy.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.175
No, I write, and I also hope

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.343
that I have good friends,

00:02:57.343 --> 00:03:00.380
and I talk my [bleep] out
with people and, you know,

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
that´s a kind of therapy,
don´t you think?

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I can be your friend.
-You think?

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. You should call me.
-You should´ve --

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.287
You know,
you came over to my house once.

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:11.057
-I did. I had a great time.
You introduced me to "Ladybug."

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:13.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um, whatever it´s called.
"Miraculous."

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.894
I didn´t know what that was.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:17.096 size:84% position:42%
-Do your kids watch it?
-Now, because of you.

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.898
-Okay.
-I do everything because of you.

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:20.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my gosh.
Is this like --

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
See? This is why
I don´t go to therapy.

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:25.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
It gets -- It gets --
It gets nowhere.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:26.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You get --
Yep, and it´s gonna --

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just talk to me.
-Do you smoke?

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Me neither.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:31.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don´t.
I smoke for photo shoots.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you never smoked?
-No.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:36.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because of your voice?
-Yeah, I just don´t like it.

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.818
-Yeah, me neither. Do you vape?

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:41.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I´d rather...

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like...opiates.

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:45.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:48.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ridiculous.
I want to show a clip.

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:53.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here is Madonna in "Madame X."
Take a look at this.

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:54.434 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
♫♫

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:11.417
-♫ It´s not gypsy blood ♫

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:13.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ We live between
life and death ♫

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:18.558 size:81% position:41%
♫ Waiting to move on ♫

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ And in the end ♫

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ We accept it ♫

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:24.264 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
♫♫

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:27.533
♫ We shake hands with our fate ♫

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:31.104 size:75% position:38%
♫ And we walk past ♫

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:33.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫ There´s no rest for us
in this world ♫

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:36.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.711 size:84% position:42%
♫ Finally a lost love ♫

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:41.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes! That´s what
I´m talking about!

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:43.549
Everybody, Madonna is here!

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
Madonna!

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:49.355 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:51.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was trying to think
of a question to ask you

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.059 size:88% position:44%
that´s never been asked.

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:55.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good luck.
-I know.

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:56.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
How about this one?
Ready for this?

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:58.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:04:58.131 --> 00:04:59.599
-This might be the best question
I´ve ever asked.

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.236
-Has any review of anything

00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:06.005
you´ve done gotten it right?

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:12.278 size:88% position:44%
Is that a good question?
-I mean, occasionally.

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:14.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s rare.
-So they don´t, really.

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:16.349
-In the 40 years that I´ve been
doing what I´ve been doing --

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
-40 years?
-40 years. Can you believe it?

00:05:18.184 --> 00:05:20.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. That´s insane.
-It is. Yeah.

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:23.589 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:25.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you know who you are?
Do you even know who you are?

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:26.793
You are Madonna. Oh, my God.

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:27.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I still don´t even know
who I am.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you really are
unbelievable.

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:32.699 size:88% position:44%
I mean, the first single
was what? "Everybody?"

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm-hmm.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.802 size:75% position:38%
-And do you remember
anything about that?

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, what would you do to --
Do you remember

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:40.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
hearing yourself on the radio,
and going, "Wow"?

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:42.475 size:88% position:44%
-I remember I was living
on the Upper West Side,

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:47.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
on 99th and Riverside Drive,
and was just broke

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.682
and wondering if things were

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:51.718
ever going to work out for me.

00:05:51.718 --> 00:05:54.287
And I had signed my record deal.

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:56.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was told that
they were going to start

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
playing my song on the radio,
"Everybody."

00:05:58.458 --> 00:05:59.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:05:59.726 --> 00:06:04.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, suddenly,
my roommate had her radio on

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:07.767
down the hall, and I heard it
drifting down the hallway.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:09.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Wait, what is that?

00:06:09.502 --> 00:06:10.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is that?"

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:11.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I ran down the hall,
and she´s like,

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:14.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
"They´re playing your song
on the radio.

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just stood there
like, "Wow!

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:20.847 size:84% position:42%
It happened. It works."

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:22.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like magic.
-Yeah.

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:23.983
-It was the most amazing moment.

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:26.386
-Is this going to be in this --
I heard there´s a rumor that --

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:28.121 size:88% position:44%
-A visual autobiography?

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:30.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, of course.
-Don´t call it a biopic.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:33.159
-But, yeah, --
I would never call it a biopic.

00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:36.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How dare you?
-No, how dare you?

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:39.599
I think it´s cool.
Once again, no one´s done this.

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:42.435
-Well, the reason I´m doing it
is because a bunch of people

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:44.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
have tried to write
movies about me,

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:46.973 size:84% position:42%
but they´re always men.

00:06:46.973 --> 00:06:48.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ugh!

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:51.611
-Wait. What do you mean?
What are you talking about?

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:53.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
No.

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:55.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
Men are good.
Some men.

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Some men are good.
-Yeah.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:07:01.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Men -- "Good men" is pretty
much an oxymoron, but --

00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:03.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh.
-Anyways...

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:05.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, because people
were writing --

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:08.027
I read Universal was doing a --

00:07:08.027 --> 00:07:10.296
Like, they sent me the script
because they wanted my blessing.

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:12.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I read it,
and it was the most hideous,

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:14.400
superficial crap I ever read.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I found out
that some --

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:18.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
I found out --

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:20.039
I´m not even gonna say his name,

00:07:20.039 --> 00:07:22.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
but he´s a total misogynist
was directing.

00:07:22.642 --> 00:07:24.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I´m thinking,
"Why would these people

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.012
make a movie about my life?"

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:27.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
There´s nothing true
in the script.

00:07:27.914 --> 00:07:30.716
The guy who is making it has
no understanding of women,

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:33.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
no appreciation of women,
no respect for women.

00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:35.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, like, this happened
a couple of times,

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:38.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I had to, like,
call people up,

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:40.426
call up the heads of studios,

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:42.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
call up my agents
and threaten them

00:07:42.829 --> 00:07:45.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
and say that I will, like,
stand in front of the building

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:49.535
and make -- and protest
and make everybody´s life

00:07:49.535 --> 00:07:51.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
a misery if
they go through with it.

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:55.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they still did not
take me seriously.

00:07:55.107 --> 00:07:58.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, finally, I just threw
down the gauntlet.

00:07:58.177 --> 00:08:01.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you ever thrown down
the gauntlet?

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.250 size:84% position:42%
-I´ve thought about it.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.318 size:81% position:41%
-Therein lies the rub.

00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:07.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to throw down
the gauntlet.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Therein lies the rub."
